@startuml
title N02 - Node radio
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "N02\nNode radio" as N02
interface "enqueue(); next_due(); record_transport_result(); apply_ack()" as API
database "Owned state\nbounded PendingTx deque, attempt count and next-attempt deadline" as State
queue "Input / output\nDomainEvent + application ACK → scheduled transmissions / retired entries" as IO
API --> N02
IO --> N02
N02 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
N02 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "N05\nNode storage" as N05
N02 ..> N05 : contract / port
component "H01\nHub ingest" as H01
N02 ..> H01 : contract / port
note bottom of N02
Flow: Queue once; expose due item; schedule deterministic jittered retry; reject volatile ACK for business events; retire only DURABLE or policy-discard ACK.
Guard: Full queue returns false. Radio success is not durable success. Backoff is bounded by the scheduled wake policy.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
